---
title: Walk With Eric
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Walk With Eric — San Francisco Walking Tours</title>
  <meta name="description" content="San Francisco walking tours led by Eric Friedman — maritime history, the city's first Black millionaire, Japanese Tea Garden, and more. Free tours through SF City Guides.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,300;0,8..60,400;1,8..60,300;1,8..60,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/main.css">
  <script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/alpinejs@3.x.x/dist/cdn.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body style="background-color: #f5f0e8; color: #2a2118;">
  <main>

    <!-- ===================== SECTIONS 1+2: MASTHEAD + INTRO ===================== -->
    <section style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);">
      <div class="masthead-h1-wrap" style="padding: 2.5rem 4rem 0.5rem;">
        <h1 class="masthead-h1" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 72px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.05; color: var(--ink); margin: 0;">Walk With Eric</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="masthead-tagline-wrap" style="padding: 0 4rem 2rem;">
        <p class="masthead-tagline" style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-mid); margin: 0;">History, stories, and a great excuse to be outside</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px; gap: 4rem; align-items: center; padding: 0 4rem 3rem;">
        <div class="intro-text">
          <p class="intro-p1" style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 1.1rem;">Walk with me on a journey from looking to seeing with understanding — the moment when a building, a street corner, or a name on a plaque stops being scenery and suddenly has something to say.</p>
          <p class="intro-p2" style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">I believe history should be engaging — thought-provoking and genuinely rewarding to encounter. That's why I scour the archives: to find the facts, yes, but more importantly to unearth the stories that make those facts land. I've been leading tours with San Francisco City Guides for years, created two of the tours I lead, and have trained dozens of other guides along the way.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-photo" style="text-align: center;">
          <img src="/images/eric.webp" alt="Eric Friedman, SF City Guides tour guide" style="width: 300px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; border: 4px solid var(--parchment-deep); filter: sepia(20%) contrast(0.95); mix-blend-mode: multiply; display: block; margin: 0 auto;">
          <p style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0.75rem 0 0;">Eric F. · SF City Guides</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== SECTION 3: CREDENTIALS STRIP ===================== -->
    <div style="background: var(--parchment-dark); border-top: 1px solid var(--parchment-deep); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--parchment-deep);">
      <div class="mob-pad" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 2rem; padding: 1.5rem 4rem; align-items: center;">

        <span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18.75px; color: var(--ink-mid); letter-spacing: 0.04em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block;"></span>
          Author, <em style="margin-left: 0.25em;"><a href="/the-ledger-and-the-mirror/" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.textDecoration='underline'" onmouseout="this.style.textDecoration='none'">The Ledger and the Mirror</a></em>
        </span>

        <span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18.75px; color: var(--ink-mid); letter-spacing: 0.04em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block;"></span>
          Featured on KALW &amp; CBS Bay Area
        </span>

        <span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18.75px; color: var(--ink-mid); letter-spacing: 0.04em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block;"></span>
          Trained dozens of City Guides volunteers
        </span>

        <span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18.75px; color: var(--ink-mid); letter-spacing: 0.04em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block;"></span>
          Founding Editor, Japanese Tea Garden Newsletter
        </span>

        <span style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18.75px; color: var(--ink-mid); letter-spacing: 0.04em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block;"></span>
          Available for speaking engagements
        </span>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== SECTION 4: QUOTES GRID ===================== -->
    <section style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;">
      <div class="mob-pad" style="padding-left: 4rem; padding-right: 4rem;">
        <div class="quotes-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem;">

          <article style="background: var(--parchment-dark); border-left: 3px solid var(--parchment-deep); padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;">
            <p style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">"Eric is exceptional. Knowledgeable, witty, and gracious — Japantown tells a terrific story, but Eric makes it memorable."</p>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0;">— Japantown</p>
          </article>

          <article style="background: var(--parchment-dark); border-left: 3px solid var(--parchment-deep); padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;">
            <p style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">"His knowledge and professionalism made it the highlight of their visit to San Francisco."</p>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0;">— Japanese Tea Garden</p>
          </article>

          <article style="background: var(--parchment-dark); border-left: 3px solid var(--parchment-deep); padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;">
            <p style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">"A great guide, great tour, and great scenery — a trifecta."</p>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0;">— Maritime San Francisco</p>
          </article>

          <article style="background: var(--parchment-dark); border-left: 3px solid var(--parchment-deep); padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;">
            <p style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">"Our family has enjoyed walking tours all over the globe, and many in San Francisco — this really was one of the best ever. Lots of gasps from our crowd at what we learned."</p>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0;">— 1840s San Francisco</p>
          </article>

          <article style="grid-column: 1 / -1; background: var(--parchment-dark); border-left: 3px solid var(--parchment-deep); padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;">
            <p style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">"Eric made a point to understand our group and tailored the experience accordingly — weaving in insights from his own background that added an extra layer of authenticity. Knowing that he offers these tours for free makes his dedication even more impressive."</p>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0;">— Boom and Bust, private tour</p>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== SECTION 5: BOOK PROMO BLOCK ===================== -->
    <div style="background: var(--ink); color: var(--parchment);">
      <div class="book-promo-grid mob-pad" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 500px; gap: 2rem; align-items: start; padding: 2.5rem 2rem;">

        <div>
          <p style="font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.25em; color: var(--gold); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0 0 0.6rem;">New from Komorebi Press</p>
          <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 24px; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; color: var(--parchment); margin: 0 0 0.35rem; line-height: 1.2;"><a href="/the-ledger-and-the-mirror/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.textDecoration='underline'" onmouseout="this.style.textDecoration='none'">The Ledger and the Mirror: William Leidesdoff and the Making of San Francisco</a></h2>
          <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.45); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; margin: 0 0 1rem;">Eric Friedman</p>
          <p style="font-size: 18.75px; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.75); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 1.25rem;">Why had California's most consequential early businessman been nearly erased from history? The Leidesdorff tour started with that question. This book is the answer — archival detective work tracing William Alexander Leidesdorff across continents, legends, and contested origins, born from the same deep curiosity that drives every walk I lead.</p>

          <div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.12); padding-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
            <p style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18.75px; font-style: italic; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.8); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 0.35rem;">"A well-researched biography of one of young San Francisco's most enigmatic citizens."</p>
            <p style="font-size: 18.75px; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.4); letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0 0 1rem;">—Gary Kamiya, author of <em>Cool Gray City of Love</em> and <em>Spirits of San Francisco</em></p>
            <p style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18.75px; font-style: italic; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.8); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 0.35rem;">"Refreshingly urgent twenty-first-century prose."</p>
            <p style="font-size: 18.75px; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.4); letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0;">—John King, author of <em>Portal</em> and <em>Cityscapes</em></p>
          </div>

          <a href="/the-ledger-and-the-mirror/" style="border: 1px solid var(--gold); color: var(--gold); font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='var(--gold)';this.style.color='var(--ink)';" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='transparent';this.style.color='var(--gold)';">About the book</a>
        </div>

        <img src="/images/latm-front-cover.webp" alt="The Ledger and the Mirror, book cover" style="width: 500px; height: auto; display: block;" class="book-cover-img">

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== SECTION 6: TOURS ===================== -->
    <section id="tours-section" style="padding-top: 2rem;">

      <!-- Section head and intro note — padded -->
      <div class="mob-pad" style="padding-left: 4rem; padding-right: 4rem; padding-bottom: 0;">

        <header style="padding-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">The Tours</p>
          <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 0.75rem; line-height: 1.2;">San Francisco's history, mysteries, and the Bay itself.</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 18.75px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">A quiet garden, a windswept bay, a neighborhood with three hidden histories, one of the city's most enigmatic founders, and the cycles of discovery, innovation, and disruption that have reinvented San Francisco and the world again and again. Riveting stories that will make you glad you came.</p>
        </header>

        <p style="font-size: 18.75px; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; padding: 0.75rem 0 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">All tours run through <a href="https://sfcityguides.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.textDecoration='underline'" onmouseout="this.style.textDecoration='none'">San Francisco City Guides</a> — a nonprofit program of the San Francisco Public Library. Every walk is free; donations support the program. Private tours are also available — ideal for work groups, family visits, or custom experiences. I lead the tours below, but the full City Guides schedule has outstanding guides across the whole city. Book whatever calls to you.</p>

      </div>

      <!-- Tour 1: Maritime San Francisco — image LEFT -->
      <article id="tour-maritime" class="tour-card">
        <div class="tour-card-image">
          <img src="/images/maritime.webp" alt="A tall ship under full sail passing the Golden Gate Bridge">
        </div>
        <div class="tour-card-text">
          <p class="tour-written-by">Tour written by Eric</p>
          <h3 class="tour-name"><a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/maritime-sf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--ink)'">Maritime San Francisco</a></h3>
          <p class="tour-desc">A tour of the City by the Bay that finally gives the Bay its due. History and culture woven together with whatever is actually unfolding in front of us — boardsport athletes, racing sailboats, Coast Guard vessels, fishing boats. I spend a fair amount of time on the water myself, and it shows.</p>
          <p class="tour-media">Featured by <a href="https://www.latitude38.com/lectronic/2025/09/29/#guided-walk-san-francisco-maritime-past-present" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Latitude 38</a></p>
          {% if schedule.maritime | length %}
          <div style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;">
            <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--gold); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0 0 0.3rem;">Upcoming</p>
            {% for d in schedule.maritime %}<p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; color: var(--ink-mid); margin: 0 0 0.15rem;">{{ d }}</p>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="tour-buttons">
            <a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/maritime-sf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Book Your Tour.</a>
            <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nv8yu3_P6hR9_ZF9g5GAbupsVxdPJjTW5kXbAxRJu-U/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Nearby Recommendations</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tour 2: 1840s San Francisco — image RIGHT -->
      <article id="tour-1840s" class="tour-card tour-card-reverse">
        <div class="tour-card-image">
          <img src="/images/1840s.webp" alt="1840s San Francisco">
        </div>
        <div class="tour-card-text">
          <p class="tour-written-by">Tour written by Eric</p>
          <h3 class="tour-name"><a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/1840s-san-francisco-and-the-astonishing-legacy-of-americas-first-black-millionaire/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--ink)'">1840s San Francisco &amp; the Legacy of America's First Black Millionaire</a></h3>
          <p class="tour-desc">I built this tour from scratch, hunting through archives for clues about a remarkable and shockingly undervalued figure in California history. The story is intriguing; the story of the story takes it even further. The research also became my book, <a href="/the-ledger-and-the-mirror/" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.textDecoration='underline'" onmouseout="this.style.textDecoration='none'">The Ledger and the Mirror</a>.</p>
          <p class="tour-media">Featured on <a href="https://www.kalw.org/show/state-bay/2025-08-24/valkyries-vibes-bay-area-unified-americas-first-black-millionaire" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KALW 91.7</a> and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_pXELxaVHCI" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CBS Bay Area</a></p>
          {% if schedule['1840s'] | length %}
          <div style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;">
            <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--gold); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0 0 0.3rem;">Upcoming</p>
            {% for d in schedule['1840s'] %}<p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; color: var(--ink-mid); margin: 0 0 0.15rem;">{{ d }}</p>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="tour-buttons">
            <a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/1840s-san-francisco-and-the-astonishing-legacy-of-americas-first-black-millionaire/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Book Your Tour.</a>
            <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LfxVYSsd9saJUW4UQYjZLLTT0lX6fz7hfk51dBmFHas" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Nearby Recommendations</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tour 3: Japanese Tea Garden — image LEFT -->
      <article id="tour-japanese-tea-garden" class="tour-card">
        <div class="tour-card-image">
          <img src="/images/japaneseteagarden.webp" alt="The Japanese Tea Garden, Golden Gate Park">
        </div>
        <div class="tour-card-text">
          <h3 class="tour-name"><a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/japanese-tea-garden/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--ink)'">Japanese Tea Garden</a></h3>
          <p class="tour-desc">People who wander in without intending to take a tour often end up staying for the whole experience. The oldest continuously operating public Japanese garden outside of Japan, the Garden was created for the 1894 Midwinter Fair. It is transformed when someone shows you how to read it: botany, history, horticulture, spiritual depth, and the iconic structures that will earn their place in your memory and photo stream.</p>
          <aside class="tour-bracket-aside">This Garden and I go deeper than the tours. After studying the Main Gate's traditional bracket system, I built a scale model of one of its roof brackets — displayed at the Garden and at the Kezuroukai woodworking gathering. The project and photos are <a href="https://justwood.design/work/tokyo-bracket/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">on my woodworking site</a>.</aside>
          {% if schedule.japaneseteagarden | length %}
          <div style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;">
            <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--gold); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0 0 0.3rem;">Upcoming</p>
            {% for d in schedule.japaneseteagarden %}<p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; color: var(--ink-mid); margin: 0 0 0.15rem;">{{ d }}</p>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="tour-buttons">
            <a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/japanese-tea-garden/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Book Your Tour.</a>
            <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lhsKlREKSpnU_VCr_fmnfQz0kgdz-dH3e71h3T1Eow4/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Nearby Recommendations</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tour 4: Boom and Bust — image RIGHT -->
      <article id="tour-boom-and-bust" class="tour-card tour-card-reverse">
        <div class="tour-card-image">
          <img src="/images/boomandbust.webp" alt="San Francisco Financial District">
        </div>
        <div class="tour-card-text">
          <h3 class="tour-name"><a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/san-francisco-boom-bust/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--ink)'">Boom and Bust</a></h3>
          <p class="tour-desc">Gold Rush. Silver Rush. Dot Com. Today's AI boom. The plummets into panic, racial violence, and displacement. A sweeping yet focused look at the city's economic rhythms from the 1840s to today — history that rhymes loudly with the present. As a veteran of the tech industry, I bring particular insight into how that sector has shaped and continues to shape the region. Especially compelling as a private tour for work groups.</p>
          {% if schedule.boomandbust | length %}
          <div style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;">
            <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--gold); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0 0 0.3rem;">Upcoming</p>
            {% for d in schedule.boomandbust %}<p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; color: var(--ink-mid); margin: 0 0 0.15rem;">{{ d }}</p>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="tour-buttons">
            <a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/san-francisco-boom-bust/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Book Your Tour.</a>
            <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sEy2sdILs1GU-u7tZVMsL388FAE-ZppbOpQP-BVCQdA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Nearby Recommendations</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tour 5: Japantown — image LEFT -->
      <article id="tour-japantown" class="tour-card">
        <div class="tour-card-image">
          <img src="/images/japantown.webp" alt="Japantown, San Francisco">
        </div>
        <div class="tour-card-text">
          <h3 class="tour-name"><a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/japantown/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--ink)'">Japantown</a></h3>
          <p class="tour-desc">San Francisco's Japantown — one of only three remaining in the US, and the largest and oldest — is also the city's most layered neighborhood, once called "the Little United Nations." Jewish, Japanese, and Black American communities each made a home here, in a neighborhood always already in flux. Food culture, public art, comparative religions, and surprising cultural crossovers. Lots of good places to eat nearby too.</p>
          {% if schedule.japantown | length %}
          <div style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;">
            <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--gold); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0 0 0.3rem;">Upcoming</p>
            {% for d in schedule.japantown %}<p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; color: var(--ink-mid); margin: 0 0 0.15rem;">{{ d }}</p>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="tour-buttons">
            <a href="https://sfcityguides.org/tour/japantown/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Book Your Tour.</a>
            <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1L7WFtLzVNASo6L24OwwiKGq-d2MUAIKTxcJtW2lEZDU/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-tour">Nearby Recommendations</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </section>

    <!-- ===================== SECTION 7: SCHEDULE BANNER ===================== -->
    <div id="ready-to-walk" class="mob-pad" style="padding-left: 4rem; padding-right: 4rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <div style="background: var(--parchment-dark); border: 1px solid var(--parchment-deep); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem; margin: 2.5rem 0;">
        <p style="font-size: 18.75px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 1rem;">My personal tour calendar shows exactly when I'm leading — but you'll need to head to the San Francisco City Guides website to book. Once there, look for Eric F. on the schedule.</p>

        {% if schedule.all | length %}
        <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          {% for event in schedule.all %}
          <p style="font-size: 18.75px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; color: var(--ink-mid); margin: 0.2rem 0;">{{ event }}</p>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        <p style="font-size: 18.75px; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;">Don't see a time that works? I may add dates soon — check back. In the meantime, you can join another excellent guide through <a href="https://sfcityguides.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.textDecoration='underline'" onmouseout="this.style.textDecoration='none'">SF City Guides</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== SECTION 8: BEYOND THE TOUR ===================== -->
    <section style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <div class="mob-pad" style="padding-left: 4rem; padding-right: 4rem;">
        <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--ink-light); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">Beyond the Tour</p>
        <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 1rem; line-height: 1.2;">When I'm not walking</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 18.75px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0.9rem;">I'm a Berkeley-based artist, craftsman, and writer. I design and build furniture, lighting, and sculptural objects, with a focus on precision joinery and material integrity. My work lives at <a href="https://justwood.design" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(139,58,26,0.3);">justwood.design</a>. I enjoy drawing and painting in various media. I spend as much time as possible in, on, and under the water.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 18.75px; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">The same impulse drives all of it: curiosity about how things come together, and why they matter.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- ===================== FOOTER ===================== -->
  <footer style="background: var(--ink);">
    <div class="mob-pad" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; padding: 2rem 4rem;">
      <p style="font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.45); font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; margin: 0;">There's always another story around the corner. Come find it.</p>
      <nav style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center;" aria-label="Footer links">
        <a href="https://instagram.com/ericofberkeley" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--parchment); text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; transition: font-size 0.15s ease;" onmouseenter="this.style.fontSize='14px'" onmouseleave="this.style.fontSize='12px'">Instagram</a>
        <span x-data="emailLink()" style="display: contents;">
          <a :href="href()" style="font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--parchment); text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; transition: font-size 0.15s ease; cursor: pointer;" onmouseenter="this.style.fontSize='14px'" onmouseleave="this.style.fontSize='12px'">Email</a>
        </span>
        <a href="/" style="font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--parchment); text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; transition: font-size 0.15s ease;" onmouseenter="this.style.fontSize='14px'" onmouseleave="this.style.fontSize='12px'">Walk With Eric</a>
        <a href="https://justwood.design" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--parchment); text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; transition: font-size 0.15s ease;" onmouseenter="this.style.fontSize='14px'" onmouseleave="this.style.fontSize='12px'">Just Wood</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- ===================== STICKY BAR ===================== -->
  <div style="position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 50; background: var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.12); padding: 0.6rem 2rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5rem;">
    <a
      href="#ready-to-walk"
      onclick="event.preventDefault(); document.getElementById('ready-to-walk').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });"
      class="sticky-link"
      style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--parchment); text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; transition: font-size 0.15s ease;"
      onmouseenter="this.style.fontSize='14px'" onmouseleave="this.style.fontSize='12px'"
    >Ready to Walk With Eric? <span style="font-size: 14px; vertical-align: middle;">↓</span></a>
    <a
      href="/the-ledger-and-the-mirror/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="sticky-link"
      style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--parchment); text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; transition: font-size 0.15s ease;"
      onmouseenter="this.style.fontSize='14px'" onmouseleave="this.style.fontSize='12px'"
    >Discover San Francisco's Forgotten Founder <span style="font-size: 14px; vertical-align: middle;">→</span></a>
  </div>

  <script>
    function emailLink() {
      return {
        href() {
          const u = 'eric';
          const d = 'walkwitheric' + String.fromCharCode(46) + 'com';
          return 'mailto:' + u + String.fromCharCode(64) + d;
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
